OL,3,AIn the studio with Kasabian: 'We never
OL,4,Athought we'd see success again'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"A little bit of hunger is good for
OL,7,Fyou," says Serge Pizzorno. "Keeps you
OL,8,Fgoing."
OL,10,FThe Kasabian frontman is describing a
OL,11,Ftypical day in his home recording
OL,12,Fstudio.
OL,14,FSnacks and phones are banned, but he
OL,15,Fmight screen a film in the background
OL,16,F(typically something by David Lynch)
OL,17,Fwhile he tinkers with his vast array of
OL,18,Fsynths and guitars.
OL,20,F"No distractions, four or five hours a
OL,21,Fday. I like to work fast.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
